WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.352
Riley: Today is the eighth meeting of the Pet Lovers Club!

2
00:00:07.353 --> 00:00:09.615
Sarah: Where’s Theo?

3
00:00:09.616 --> 00:00:13.733
Ben: Here he is.

4
00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:18.460
Theo: Hi, everyone! I was at the sports store.

5
00:00:18.461 --> 00:00:21.538
My mom bought me a new soccer ball. Skyler:

6
00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:23.643
I’m playing soccer too.

7
00:00:23.644 --> 00:00:25.765
Which team are you on?

8
00:00:25.766 --> 00:00:29.089
Theo: I’m on Coach Ryan’s team.

9
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.638
Skyler: I’m on the same team!

10
00:00:31.639 --> 00:00:33.592
Riley: So am I.

11
00:00:33.593 --> 00:00:36.747
We'll play at the park on Saturday.

12
00:00:36.748 --> 00:00:38.892
Skyler: I’m so nervous.

13
00:00:38.893 --> 00:00:41.237
It’s my first soccer game.

14
00:00:41.238 --> 00:00:45.046
I really want to score a goal! Sarah:

15
00:00:45.047 --> 00:00:48.052
I’ll bring Mittens and cheer for your team. I

16
00:00:48.053 --> 00:00:50.675
bought her a pretty blue ribbon. Chatter: Blue,

17
00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:56.280
blue, blue! Skyler: Bad

18
00:00:56.281 --> 00:00:57.847
boy, Chatter! Don’t

19
00:00:57.848 --> 00:01:02.277
peck at Mittens’ new ribbon. Ben:

20
00:01:02.278 --> 00:01:05.804
Chatter must like the color blue. Skyler:

21
00:01:05.805 --> 00:01:07.641
Yes, he does. He

22
00:01:07.642 --> 00:01:11.696
pecked two blue buttons off my dress. Chatter:

23
00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:14.703
Go, team! Skyler:

24
00:01:14.704 --> 00:01:19.615
Chatter has been watching soccer on TV. Theo:

25
00:01:19.616 --> 00:01:22.132
That gives me an idea. Riley:

26
00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:24.150
What? Theo:

27
00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:27.228
Chatter can be our team mascot. Sarah:

28
00:01:27.229 --> 00:01:30.595
What’s a mascot? Ben:

29
00:01:30.596 --> 00:01:34.000
A mascot brings a team good luck. Skyler:

30
00:01:34.001 --> 00:01:37.198
Chatter is very good luck! Skyler:

31
00:01:37.199 --> 00:01:40.365
I’m going to practice every day after school.

32
00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:43.098
I want our team to win!

33
00:01:43.099 --> 00:01:47.098
Riley: This is going to be fun.

34
00:01:47.099 --> 00:01:50.258
Theo: I can’t wait until Saturday.

35
00:01:50.259 --> 00:01:57.881
Skyler: Me neither. With Chatter on our side, we'll win for sure!

